| "Split a bill into whole-cent shares that add up to total_cents." | Docstring kept by the commit | refuted | Same output as above |
| Project tests pass | Implied | confirmed, but they don't cover this | `Ran 5 tests in 0.001s` / `OK`, exit 0. `tests/test_pricing.py` only checks `split_bill(900, 3) == [300, 300, 300]` and that `people=0` raises, so it never tries an uneven split. |

